<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI8-BLOCKING-03-VALIDATION-TESTS>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI8-BLOCKING-03-VALIDATION-TESTS" ;
  triage:title "Required validation test artifacts are entirely absent — CLI integration tests, doctor redaction test, unit tests on validate_enabled_peer_configuration()" ;
  triage:description "AI8-QA-1 (req-qa ATM-QA-004/ATM-QA-005/ATM-QA-006, rust-qa-agent QA-002 — 2 independent confirmations). The sprint doc's own 'Required validation' section lists CLI integration tests, doctor redaction tests, and (implicitly) coverage of the fail-closed startup gate — none exist in the codebase. No test anywhere exercises 'atm peer interface|certificate|trust' subcommands (list/set/remove/init/add/replace/revoke, --yes gating); no test proves the doctor projection path never serializes private_key_ref; validate_enabled_peer_configuration() itself has zero unit tests. This blocks acceptance of deliverables 3 (doctor redaction), 4 (peer commands), and 5 (bind-preflight validation)." ;
