  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-20T19:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:notes "Required tests: (1) CLI integration tests for atm peer interface list/show, certificate show/init/revoke, trust list/add/replace/revoke with --yes gating verification, (2) unit tests on validate_enabled_peer_configuration for valid/invalid/missing scenarios, (3) doctor test that verifies no serialization of private_key_ref in output, (4) end-to-end doctor test covering healthy peer config projection." .

